<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan army bombed an ELN camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, and a drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. President Trump boasted about a one-day operation to capture Maduro and warned of possible U.S. action against Cuba while claiming Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. Opposition leader María Corina Machado returned to Venezuela and called for elections in her first address since returning. Chevron is expanding operations in Venezuela and Exxon is urging caution. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPMTlvMlFLS3dOcXlXRmV3eFdaeVFlZlJ5V0xoZkFiRGw3Zm1LX3FTa3RrWUhOWlk0SzRUUzNJeGVuMVVrTkt2bzR1ZWp3by1Bb1NybkhGbUhaRmpwWTRLVU5ENnl6OFdxM0Y2YnFvV3JXb1NuY09TUHl3S0pISzh0em1aR0s?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNREVjOXhzQVc3YV9DUGp6bk90UFl4bllIWF8wendwdUh4WEpsYk5LOXJyVWFiZVN4U1Rub3MzN0piZDJJcmRCRDV3YVo2bTE3VjZ0bl9rbkZ4SlZkVDNaVFZsQU10NzU2VnhNODdzdHkteTdCMHNuSVFVOGFZM3dxT1piZnZKeDk5UzVyLWxyWE83Q09H?oc=5&quot;&gt;Venezuelanalysis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOOUM4UTdhbURtWXU3dmx1dHgwclFqYUw1MUh5TUFtSkF3S2pFemdpUzZ1SFVJbTQ1MkwzdzJpcXJFOXUwR2NMNElSbnAyTTl2cUxrV2d0ejBOOHpTVUg5OHZXdDVhc2VYbngxMkROc1hHaGd1Rm1yQkwzSVVHTlF4QzI2N2dTQ29fenExcFNxTFlDVHAwWF9oQTNMNUxWcW42NmZITkVoQWMyc0pQZjRnMXZkZkw5U3FDNjZtSGV0LXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;KSL News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQN0tvOFlKV1dMczhCeldlcXRab0xNcndLYmpOdG15SDZOYkRIbmM2OG5pendUT1hpOTJ1SEFRc2ctQ0NpbXp4OTRFQ3I1a3JkZXBDcHZqV3dmLV9EZTVnOTgySlVYbVZ6Y0s3ZFhwS3R3bl9wU2NYMlM5REgxZmhOeFhwSUdHZnRyUmp4UzZFVHB